---
import { Github, Linkedin, Mail, Twitter, Briefcase } from "lucide-react";
---

<section class="py-12 md:py-20 animate-slide-up">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <h2
      class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-secondary mb-6 leading-tight"
    >
      Full-stack products, from the UI to the systems behind it.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl">
      I build in TypeScript end to end: React and Next.js front ends, NestJS
      back ends, and the infrastructure they run on. Most of my work has been
      in fintech and Web3, where a dropped or duplicated transaction isn't
      acceptable. Lately I also build the AI layer on top: LLM pipelines and
      multi-agent systems, with deterministic checks that make their output
      safe to ship. 6+ years of turning messy requirements into production
      software.
    </p>

    <div class="flex gap-4">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/n4beel"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="p-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-50 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100"
      >
        <Github size={20} />
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://linkedin.com/in/nabeel-a-khan"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="p-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-50 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100"
      >
        <Linkedin size={20} />
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://x.com/n4beel1"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="p-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-50 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100"
      >
        <Twitter size={20} />
      </a>
      <a
        href="mailto:contact@nabeelkhan.dev"
        class="p-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-50 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100"
      >
        <Mail size={20} />
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://earn.superteam.fun/t/n4beel"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="p-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-300 bg-gray-50 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100"
      >
        <Briefcase size={20} />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
